/*
  VehiclePhotoUpload.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 feature view · 0307 · VehiclePhotoUpload (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface (table "VehiclePhotoUpload").
  Every key the native surface resolves lives here with its web `t(key, default)` English
  value. These entries fold into the app `Localizable.xcstrings` master catalog at
  integration time; they are kept in a per-surface table so each parallel surface prompt
  owns its own strings without editing the shared catalog.

  The first group is the exact set of keys extracted from the web source
  (features/vehicles/components/VehiclePhotoUpload.tsx) — the panel title, the preview
  alt, the drop prompt, the size/format constraints, the CTA ladder, the remove action,
  the confirm dialog copy, and the four toast messages — plus the shared `common.remove`.
  The second group is the native chrome the web hook hardcodes in English (the client-side
  validation messages) or that the Apple leaf contract adds (the load/error a11y, the
  retry, the freshness chip + banner, the toast dismiss), so the Swift sources hold no
  English literals.
*/

